Modified 2026-10-03 by Tubcal for Android: this directory holds a subset of the
weeb_cli package from the weeb-cli 3.0.0 release. The files present are unchanged.
These parts of the release were left out because the app only uses one stream
provider: commands/, locales/, templates/, ui/, utils/, constants.py, i18n.py,
__main__.py, main.py, and services/ aniskip, _base, cache, dependency_manager,
details, discord_rpc, download/, downloader, error_handler, headless_downloader,
local_library, notifier, player, progress, scraper, search, shortcuts,
stream_validator, _tracker_base, tracker, updater, watch. The complete source is
the 3.0.0 release, at the link above.
